 "honest_note": "T4 (ON-edge) and T5 (OFF-edge) are the direction-selective motion detectors; this graph unions their downstream walks and keeps every real pre-edge (T4 and T5 both synapse onto the shared classes). The textbook pathway landed on real rows: T4->lobula plate tangential neuron (tw=282410) and T5->lobula plate tangential neuron (tw=529105), plus lobula plate intrinsic/giant neurons. Hop-2 reaches secondary neurons and columnar classes. 'secondary neuron' failed all query forms (honest hop-1 terminal); 'adult visual neuropil intrinsic neuron' returned 0 downstream rows (honest hop-1 terminal). T4's grouped queries died server-side; the named DownstreamClassConnectivity fallback worked."
